Data.DatabaseSchemes:
CREATE TABLE Users (
  UserId VARCHAR(36) PRIMARY KEY,
  Email VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL UNIQUE,
  CreatedAt DATETIME NOT NULL
);

CREATE TABLE PageViews (
  PageViewId VARCHAR(36) PRIMARY KEY,
  UserId VARCHAR(36),
  PagePath VARCHAR(512) NOT NULL,
  ViewTimestamp DATETIME NOT NULL
);

Storage Tech Summary: Relational databases (Azure SQL Database, AWS RDS for PostgreSQL/MySQL, GCP Cloud SQL for PostgreSQL/MySQL) are chosen for their ACID compliance, structured data handling, and managed service benefits.
